    "text": "## sub_5383D0_005383d0 — Huffman tree builder (heap-based)\n\n**Summary:** Builds optimal Huffman code tree from symbol frequency table. Collects non-zero frequency entries, ensures minimum 2 symbols, constructs binary tree via min-heap (HeapSiftDown), assigns code lengths, then calls RankRedistribution to enforce max-length constraint and FrequencyTableConstruction to generate canonical Huffman codes. Core tree construction for deflate encoder.\n\n**Frame-path:** NOT_FOUND  \n**Call frequency:** UNKNOWN (no static path from tick root)\n\n**Called by:** HuffmanBitStreamEncoder (005381f0), PerformanceSectorTimeAccumulator (00538940)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| this | 0x0 | R | — | frequency table base pointer (a2[0], *a2) |\n| this | 0x4 | RW | — | max symbol index / tree root (a2[1]) |\n| this | 0x8 | R | — | tree state block pointer (a2[2]) |\n| this | 0x14 | R | — | symbol count / tree node count (a2[5]) |\n\n**Written-by note (persistence):**\n- this 0x4: overwritten with tree root index each call\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 005385e0 | HeapSiftDown | restore min-heap property for Huffman tree construction |\n| 005386c0 | RankRedistribution | enforce maximum code length constraint (redistribute rank lengths) |\n| 005388d0 | FrequencyTableConstruction | generate canonical Huffman codes from computed code lengths |\n\n**Guard conditions:** When a symbol's frequency word (at v4+4*v8) is zero, its code length field (at v4+4*v8+2) is zeroed. When non-zero frequency count (a1+5190) < 2 after initial collection, dummy symbols are synthesized to ensure minimum tree size. Tree building loop continues while symbol count (a1+5190) >= 2.\n"
